  "full_name": "sany07/job-portal-django",
  "description": "DJobPortal is a job posting site developed in Django. Where Employer can Register their Company profile, Login Then add Job Post. Employee  can bookmark \u0026 apply for the Job. There is a dashboard section where Employer can check his job posting list \u0026 applicants details also can delete and update his job post. Employee can see his job bookmark list \u0026 can update his profile.",
  "description_ja": "DJobPortal は Django で開発された求人掲載サイトです。雇用主は会社プロファイルを登録・ログインして求人を掲載できます。求職者は求人をブックマークして応募できます。雇用主は求人リストや応募者の詳細を確認・削除・更新できるダッシュボードがあります。求職者もブックマークリストの確認やプロフィール更新が可能です。",
